<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Nishat Tek first half net dips.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Nishat Tek first half net dips.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half ended</p>
<p>December 31, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales		 236 vs 187</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit     17 vs  44</p>
<p>    Post-tax profit    17 vs  44</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Nishat Tek Ltd. It generates electricity and supplies to its sister companies in central Pakistan. There is no book closure as the company has not announced any dividend.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
